OL,3,GNEWSAResidents find 'huge' rats near to
OL,4,Aflats site
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in Blackpool, who live next
OL,7,Fto a huge former civil service office
OL,8,Fwhich is being transformed into flats,
OL,9,Fhave said they are suffering from an
OL,10,Foutbreak of rats.
OL,12,FThey fear the rodents are coming from
OL,13,FMexford House, on Mexford Avenue in
OL,14,FNorth Shore, which was previously home
OL,15,Fto the Department for Work and Pensions
OL,16,Funtil 2009 and is currently a building
OL,17,Fsite.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
