OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAResidents find 'huge' rats near to
OL,4,Aflats site
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the past month, residents said they
OL,7,Fhad been shocked by a large numbers of
OL,8,Frats in their homes or under their
OL,9,Ffloorboards, some of which had been
OL,10,Fkilled by local cats.
OL,12,FLaura Smith said she had to buy rat
OL,13,Ftraps after finding a "huge" rat in her
OL,14,Fkitchen. Owner of Mexford House, The
OL,15,FMexford Group, has been contacted for a
OL,16,Fresponse.
